SUMMARY:MISTRANSLATED
LOCATION:Just the Tonic at The Caves\, 253 Cowgate\, Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:Mistranslated is an interactive stand-up comedy show about the 
 absurd and hilarious side of speaking (and misspeaking) languages\, deliver
 ed by a polyglot comedian who does comedy in seven languages. This show is 
 a masterclass in how to (badly) learn a foreign language\, offering hacks a
 nd tips while featuring tales of languages fails\, tonal triumphs and final
 ly being able to understand what those Thai masseuses are saying. It's all 
 in English\, but with no promises you won't walk away knowing how to bargai
 n in Indonesian or chitchat about dried fish in Norwegian.\nMore info: http
 s://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/mistranslated/
URL:https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/mistranslated/
END:VEVENT
